### E2E 3: Insufficient Evidence

The system returns the honest unresolved state.

### E2E 4: Knowledge Reuse

A real Knowledge Reuse Record is created.

### E2E 5: Knowledge Revision

Prior versions remain available.

### E2E 6: Duplicate Event Replay

No duplicate state or metrics are created.

