# Final Definition

CivilOS MVP is not a chatbot with memory.

CivilOS MVP is not a theatrical multiagent conversation.

CivilOS MVP is not a decorative Knowledge Graph.

CivilOS MVP is a working proof that validated knowledge can become a persistent, reusable, revisable, and compounding system asset.

Agents create contributions.

CivilOS creates knowledge.

The system must remain honest about uncertainty, unavailable providers, failed tasks, rejected hypotheses, and incomplete evidence.

No fake output.

No simulated system activity.

No invented metrics.

No hidden validation.

No silent history changes.

If it is not real, it is not shown.
